  "title": "Like",
  "group": "Microinteractions",
  "order": 3,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Endorsing something is optimistic: the heart fills, pops and throws seven sparks the moment it is pressed, and the count rolls up, before the server answers. If the server refuses, it rolls back with a shake and says why.",
    "id": "Memberi dukungan bersifat optimistis: hati terisi, memantul, dan melontarkan tujuh percikan begitu ditekan, dan jumlahnya bergulir naik, sebelum server menjawab. Jika server menolak, semuanya kembali dengan goyangan dan alasannya ditampilkan."
  },
  "titleId": "Like",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Support a proposal",
        "desc": "Press the heart: it fills at once, pops and bursts; the count rolls to 129. Press again to take it back (no burst on the way off).",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <p class=\"card__title\">Street lights on Jalan Pagar Alam keep going out</p>\n  <p class=\"card__sub\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">Proposal to replace the lamps on three poles near the bus stop. It has been completely dark for four nights.</p>\n  <div class=\"docs-row\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\"><button class=\"like\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-lds-like aria-label=\"Like\"><span class=\"like__heart\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">favorite</span></span><span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"128\"></span></button><button class=\"btn btn--plain btn--sm\">Reply</button></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "When the server says no",
        "desc": "This one is refused after 700 ms: the heart empties, the count rolls back, the button shakes, and the reason appears in words.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 360px;\">\n  <div class=\"docs-row\"><button class=\"like\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-lds-like aria-label=\"Like\" onclick=\"if (this.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true') { const err = this.nextElementSibling; setTimeout(() => import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => { m.likeRevert(this); err.hidden = false; }), 700); }\"><span class=\"like__heart\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">favorite</span></span><span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"41\"></span></button><span class=\"field__help field__help--error\" hidden><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">wifi_off</span>Could not save your like. You are offline.</span></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<button class=\"like\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-lds-like aria-label=\"Like\">\n  <span class=\"like__heart\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">favorite</span></span>\n  <span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"41\"></span>\n</button>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { likeRevert } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  btn.addEventListener('lds:change', async (e) => {\n    try { await saveLike(e.detail.pressed); }\n    catch { likeRevert(btn); showReason('Could not save your like. You are offline.'); }\n  });\n</script>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Mendukung sebuah usulan",
        "desc": "Tekan hatinya: langsung terisi, memantul, dan meledak; jumlahnya bergulir ke 129. Tekan lagi untuk menariknya (tanpa ledakan saat dimatikan).",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <p class=\"card__title\">Lampu jalan di Jalan Pagar Alam sering padam</p>\n  <p class=\"card__sub\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">Usul agar tiga tiang dekat halte diganti lampu baru. Sudah gelap total selama empat malam.</p>\n  <div class=\"docs-row\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\"><button class=\"like\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-lds-like aria-label=\"Suka\"><span class=\"like__heart\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">favorite</span></span><span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"128\"></span></button><button class=\"btn btn--plain btn--sm\">Balas</button></div>\n</div>"
